@Component
script MiniMapUIManager extends Component

	-- 실제 타일과 맵 오브젝트를 배경/배우 없이 캡처하고 위치 마커만 실시간 갱신한다.
	-- 캡처 카메라는 클라이언트에서만 잠깐 사용하며 원래 카메라와 렌더 상태를 복구한다.
	-- 전용 UI 그룹(MiniMapUI)에 미리 만들어 둔 풀 엔티티를 재배치하는 방식이라
	-- UI 엔티티를 런타임에 생성하지 않는다(대량 엔티티 함정 회피).
	-- 클라이언트 전용: 미니맵은 각자 화면 표시일 뿐 서버 상태가 없다.

	property integer FhPool = 120                -- 발판 선 풀 크기(.ui의 FH_N 개수와 일치)
	property integer MobPool = 40                -- 몬스터 점 풀 크기
	property integer SumPool = 8                 -- 소환수 점 풀 크기
	property number ZoomMultiplier = 1.0256410256 -- 기존 표시 범위보다 30% 더 멀리 보인다.

	@ExecSpace("ClientOnly")
	method void OnBeginPlay()
		-- 풀 엔티티 캐시. 컨트롤러는 그룹 루트의 자식이라 부모(루트) 밑 Board에서 찾는다.
		local root = self.Entity.Parent
		if not isvalid(root) then return end
		local board = root:GetChildByName("Board", false)
		if not isvalid(board) then
			log_warning("[MiniMap] Board 엔티티를 찾지 못함")
			return
		end
		self._T.board = board
		-- 전용 캡처 컨트롤러는 유지하고 표시 창만 공용 창 계층으로 옮긴다.
		local windows = _EntityService:GetEntityByPath("/ui/DefaultGroup")
		if isvalid(windows) then
			board:AttachTo(windows)
			_UILogic:SetSiblingIndex(board.UITransformComponent, 1)
			if Environment:IsMakerPlay() then log("[MiniMap] shared window stack ready: " .. board.Path) end
		end
        board.UITransformComponent.AlignmentOption=AlignmentType.TopLeft
        board.UITransformComponent.AnchorsMin=Vector2(0,1)
        board.UITransformComponent.AnchorsMax=Vector2(0,1)
        board.UITransformComponent.Pivot=Vector2(0,1)
        board.UITransformComponent.anchoredPosition=Vector2.zero
		self._T.collapsed = false
		self._T.expandedSize = board.UITransformComponent.RectSize
		self._T.viewport = board:GetChildByName("MapViewport", false)
		if not isvalid(self._T.viewport) then
			log_warning("[MiniMap] MapViewport 엔티티를 찾지 못함")
			return
		end
		self._T.ending = false
		self._T.captureTiles = {}
		for i = 1, 32 do
			self._T.captureTiles[i] = self._T.viewport:GetChildByName("Tile_" .. tostring(i), false)
		end
		self._T.previewRects = {}
		self._T.fhPool = {}
		for i = 1, self.FhPool do
			self._T.fhPool[i] = board:GetChildByName("FH_" .. tostring(i), false)
		end
		self._T.mobPool = {}
		self._T.mobSizes = {}
		for i = 1, self.MobPool do
			self._T.mobPool[i] = board:GetChildByName("MOB_" .. tostring(i), false)
			if isvalid(self._T.mobPool[i]) then self._T.mobSizes[i]=self._T.mobPool[i].UITransformComponent.RectSize end
		end
		self._T.sumPool = {}
		for i = 1, self.SumPool do
			self._T.sumPool[i] = board:GetChildByName("SUM_" .. tostring(i), false)
		end
		self._T.ply = board:GetChildByName("PLY", false)
		self._T.artwork = board:GetChildByName("RegionArtwork", false)
		self._T.mapName = board:GetChildByName("MapName", false)
		self._T.regionName = board:GetChildByName("RegionName", false)
		if isvalid(self._T.artwork) then self._T.artwork.Enable = false end
		self:WireWindowControls()
		self:LayoutChrome()
		if Environment:IsMakerPlay() then log("[MiniMap] single collapse toggle ready; follow dead zone enabled") end
	end

	@ExecSpace("ClientOnly")
	method void WireWindowControls()
		-- 제목줄 드래그와 단일 접기 버튼만 연결한다. 확대율 조절/회색 리사이즈 점은 사용하지 않는다.
		local board = self._T.board
		if not isvalid(board) then return end
		self._T.handlers = {}
		local moveGrip = board:GetChildByName("MoveGrip", false)
		local resizeGrip = board:GetChildByName("ResizeGrip", false)
		local btnDown = board:GetChildByName("BtnSizeDown", false)
		local btnUp = board:GetChildByName("BtnSizeUp", false)

		if isvalid(moveGrip) then
			local h = moveGrip:ConnectEvent(UITouchDragEvent, function(evt)
				---@type UITouchDragEvent
				local e = evt
				if not _UIClickArbiter:AcceptClickAt("/ui/DefaultGroup/Board", e.TouchPoint) then return end
				local tf = board.UITransformComponent
				local p = tf.anchoredPosition
				-- 왼쪽/위쪽 테두리는 화면 끝까지 붙일 수 있다.
				tf.anchoredPosition = Vector2(
					math.max(0, math.min(1920 - tf.RectSize.x - 8, p.x + e.TouchDelta.x)),
					math.min(0, math.max(-1080 + tf.RectSize.y + 8, p.y + e.TouchDelta.y)))
			end)
			table.insert(self._T.handlers, { entity = moveGrip, eventType = UITouchDragEvent, eventHandler = h })
		end

		if isvalid(resizeGrip) then resizeGrip.Enable = false end
		if isvalid(btnUp) then btnUp.Enable = false end

		if isvalid(btnDown) and isvalid(btnDown.ButtonComponent) then
			local h = btnDown:ConnectEvent(ButtonClickEvent, function()
				_UIEquipInventoryManager:BringWindowToFront("/ui/DefaultGroup/Board")
				self:ToggleCollapsed()
			end)
			table.insert(self._T.handlers, { entity = btnDown, eventType = ButtonClickEvent, eventHandler = h })
		end
	end

	@ExecSpace("ClientOnly")
	method void ToggleCollapsed()
		-- 접을 때는 제목 한 줄만 남기고 펼칠 때 직전 크기와 표시 상태를 복원한다.
		local board = self._T.board
		if not isvalid(board) or self._T.capturing then return end
		self._T.collapsed = not self._T.collapsed
		local btn = board:GetChildByName("BtnSizeDown", false)
		if self._T.collapsed then
			self._T.expandedSize = board.UITransformComponent.RectSize
			self._T.collapsedChildren = {}
			for _, child in ipairs(board.Children:ToTable()) do
				if child.Name ~= "MiniTitle" and child.Name ~= "MoveGrip" and child.Name ~= "BtnSizeDown" and child.Name ~= "HeaderChrome" and child.Name ~= "OuterFrame" then
					table.insert(self._T.collapsedChildren, {entity = child, enabled = child.Enable})
					child.Enable = false
				end
			end
			board.UITransformComponent.RectSize = Vector2(self._T.expandedSize.x, 38)
		else
			board.UITransformComponent.RectSize = self._T.expandedSize
			for _, rec in ipairs(self._T.collapsedChildren or {}) do
				if isvalid(rec.entity) then rec.entity.Enable = rec.enabled end
			end
			self:LayoutPreview()
			local player = _UserService.LocalPlayer
			if isvalid(player) and isvalid(player.CurrentMap) then self:UpdateMarkers(player.CurrentMap, player) end
		end
		self:LayoutChrome()
		if isvalid(btn) then btn.TextGUIRendererComponent.Text = self._T.collapsed and "+" or "-" end
		local tf = board.UITransformComponent
		local pos = tf.anchoredPosition
		tf.anchoredPosition = Vector2(
			math.max(0, math.min(1920 - tf.RectSize.x - 8, pos.x)),
			math.min(0, math.max(-1080 + tf.RectSize.y + 8, pos.y)))
		if Environment:IsMakerPlay() then log("[MiniMap] collapsed=" .. tostring(self._T.collapsed) .. " height=" .. tostring(board.UITransformComponent.RectSize.y)) end
	end

	@ExecSpace("ClientOnly")
	method void ResizeBoard(number deltaWidth, number deltaHeight)
		-- 같은 캡처를 다시 배치한다. 크기 조절 때 카메라를 다시 캡처하지 않는다.
		local board = self._T.board
		if not isvalid(board) then return end
		local tf = board.UITransformComponent
		local nextWidth = math.max(300, math.min(720, tf.RectSize.x + deltaWidth))
		local nextHeight = math.max(240, math.min(432, tf.RectSize.y + deltaHeight))
		tf.RectSize = Vector2(nextWidth, nextHeight)
		local moveGrip = board:GetChildByName("MoveGrip", false)
		if isvalid(moveGrip) then moveGrip.UITransformComponent.RectSize = Vector2(nextWidth - 84, 28) end
		for _, name in ipairs({"RegionName", "MapName"}) do
			local label = board:GetChildByName(name, false)
			if isvalid(label) then label.UITransformComponent.RectSize = Vector2(nextWidth - 106, label.UITransformComponent.RectSize.y) end
		end
		if #(self._T.previewRects or {}) == 0 and isvalid(self._T.builtMap) then self:RebuildFootholds(self._T.builtMap) end
		self:LayoutPreview()
		if Environment:IsMakerPlay() then log("[MiniMap] 크기 변경 " .. tostring(math.floor(nextWidth)) .. "x" .. tostring(math.floor(nextHeight))) end
	end

	@ExecSpace("ClientOnly")
	method void OnEndPlay()
		-- 도중 종료/맵 이동에도 카메라 및 배경 상태를 남기지 않는다.
		self._T.ending = true
		self:RestoreCapture(false)
		self:ClearPreview()
		if self._T.handlers ~= nil then
			for _, rec in ipairs(self._T.handlers) do
				if isvalid(rec.entity) then rec.entity:DisconnectEvent(rec.eventType, rec.eventHandler) end
			end
			self._T.handlers = {}
		end
	end

	@ExecSpace("ClientOnly")
	method void OnUpdate(number delta)
		self._T.captureRetryDelay = math.max(0, (self._T.captureRetryDelay or 0) - delta)
		-- 지형/마커는 같은 20Hz 좌표계를 사용하고, 맵 엔티티 검색은 5Hz로 제한한다.
		self._T.acc = (self._T.acc or 0) + delta
		self._T.scanAcc = (self._T.scanAcc or 0) + delta
		if self._T.acc < 0.05 then return end
		self._T.acc = 0
		if not isvalid(self._T.board) then return end
		local player = _UserService.LocalPlayer
		if not isvalid(player) then return end
		local map = player.CurrentMap
		if not isvalid(map) then return end
		if self._T.capturing then return end
		if self._T.collapsed then return end
		if _LoginFlow ~= nil and not _LoginFlow:IsInGame() then return end
		if self._T.captureVisit ~= map then
			self._T.captureVisit = map
			self._T.captureAttempts = 0
			self._T.captureRetryMap = nil
			self._T.captureRetryDelay = 0
		end
		if self._T.captureRetryMap == map and self._T.captureRetryDelay <= 0 then
			self._T.captureRetryMap = nil
			self._T.builtMap = nil
		end
		-- 맵이 바뀌면 발판 레이아웃을 다시 그린다(발판은 정적이라 맵 전환 때만).
		if self._T.builtMap ~= map then
			self._T.followInitialized = false
			self._T.followTargetX, self._T.followTargetY = nil, nil
			self:UpdateMapIdentity(map)
			self:RebuildFootholds(map)
			self:CapturePreview(map)
		end
		-- 캡처의 비동기 대기 중 다른 맵으로 이동했으면 다음 틱에 새 맵을 만든다.
		if not isvalid(player) or not isvalid(map) or player.CurrentMap ~= map then return end
		local pos = player.TransformComponent.WorldPosition
		self:FollowPosition(pos.x, pos.y)
		self:UpdateMarkers(map, player)
        self:UpdateCameraFrame(map)
	end

    @ExecSpace("ClientOnly")
    method void UpdateCameraFrame(Entity map)
        -- Project the actual rendered camera corners into the same coordinates as the preview tiles.
        local viewport = self._T.viewport
        local scale = self._T.mapScale
        if not isvalid(viewport) or scale == nil or scale <= 0 then return end
        local a = _UILogic:ScreenToWorldPosition(Vector2.zero)
        local b = _UILogic:ScreenToWorldPosition(Vector2(_UILogic.ScreenWidth, _UILogic.ScreenHeight))
        local left = (math.min(a.x,b.x) - self._T.mapCx) * scale
        local right = (math.max(a.x,b.x) - self._T.mapCx) * scale
        local bottom = (math.min(a.y,b.y) - self._T.mapCy) * scale
        local top = (math.max(a.y,b.y) - self._T.mapCy) * scale
        local hw, hh = self._T.halfW, self._T.halfH
        local lx, rx = math.max(-hw,left), math.min(hw,right)
        local by, ty = math.max(-hh,bottom), math.min(hh,top)
        local edges = {
            {"CameraTop",(lx+rx)/2,top,rx-lx,1.5,top>=-hh and top<=hh and rx>lx},
            {"CameraBottom",(lx+rx)/2,bottom,rx-lx,1.5,bottom>=-hh and bottom<=hh and rx>lx},
            {"CameraLeft",left,(by+ty)/2,1.5,ty-by,left>=-hw and left<=hw and ty>by},
            {"CameraRight",right,(by+ty)/2,1.5,ty-by,right>=-hw and right<=hw and ty>by}}
        for _,edge in ipairs(edges) do
            local e=viewport:GetChildByName(edge[1])
            if isvalid(e) then
                e.Enable=edge[6]
                if e.Enable then
                    e.UITransformComponent.anchoredPosition=Vector2(edge[2],edge[3])
                    e.UITransformComponent.RectSize=Vector2(edge[4],edge[5])
                end
            end
        end
        if Environment:IsMakerPlay() and self._T.cameraFrameMap~=map then
            self._T.cameraFrameMap=map
            log("[VRF] MiniMap camera frame map="..map.Name.." worldWidth="..tostring(math.abs(b.x-a.x)).." worldHeight="..tostring(math.abs(b.y-a.y)))
        end
    end

	@ExecSpace("ClientOnly")
	method void ClearPreview()
		-- 이전 맵의 RawImage 참조를 해제해 맵을 이동할수록 메모리가 쌓이지 않게 한다.
		for _, e in ipairs(self._T.captureTiles or {}) do
			if isvalid(e) then
				e.RawImageGUIRendererComponent:SetRawImage(nil)
				e.Enable = false
			end
		end
		self._T.previewRects = {}
	end

	@ExecSpace("ClientOnly")
	method void LayoutChrome()
		-- Board의 둥근 배경만 사용하고 중복 회색 외곽 프레임은 숨긴다.
		local board = self._T.board
		if not isvalid(board) then return end
		local s = board.UITransformComponent.RectSize
		local outer = board:GetChildByName("OuterFrame", false)
		if isvalid(outer) then
			outer.Enable = false
		end
		local header = board:GetChildByName("HeaderChrome", false)
		if isvalid(header) then
			header.UITransformComponent.RectSize = Vector2(s.x, self._T.collapsed and 38 or 115)
			local names = header:GetChildByName("NameSurface", false)
			if isvalid(names) then names.Enable = not self._T.collapsed end
		end
		-- 새로 만든 프레임이 기존 제목/접기 버튼보다 앞에 삽입되지 않도록 명시한다.
		if not self._T.chromeOrdered then
			for _, name in ipairs({"BottomChrome", "RightChrome", "LeftChrome", "HeaderChrome"}) do
				local chrome = board:GetChildByName(name, false)
				if isvalid(chrome) then _UILogic:SetSiblingIndex(chrome.UITransformComponent, 1) end
			end
			self._T.chromeOrdered = true
		end
		for _, name in ipairs({"LeftChrome", "RightChrome"}) do
			local edge = board:GetChildByName(name, false)
			if isvalid(edge) then edge.UITransformComponent.RectSize = Vector2(18, math.max(0, s.y - 132)) end
		end
		local bottom = board:GetChildByName("BottomChrome", false)
		if isvalid(bottom) then bottom.UITransformComponent.RectSize = Vector2(s.x, 17) end
	end

	@ExecSpace("ClientOnly")
	method void LayoutPreview()
		-- 프레임, 지형 이미지와 마커가 동일한 월드 좌표 변환을 사용한다.
		if not isvalid(self._T.board) or self._T.collapsed then return end
		self:LayoutChrome()
		local size = self._T.board.UITransformComponent.RectSize
		local w, h = size.x - 16, size.y - 123
		self._T.contentOffsetY = -53.5
		self._T.halfW, self._T.halfH = w / 2 - 6, h / 2 - 6
		local frame = self._T.board:GetChildByName("MapFrame", false)
		if isvalid(frame) then
			frame.UITransformComponent.RectSize = Vector2(w, h)
			frame.UITransformComponent.anchoredPosition = Vector2(0, self._T.contentOffsetY)
		end
		if isvalid(self._T.viewport) then
			self._T.viewport.UITransformComponent.RectSize = Vector2(w, h)
			self._T.viewport.UITransformComponent.anchoredPosition = Vector2(0, self._T.contentOffsetY)
		end
		if self._T.previewBounds == nil then return end
		local bounds = self._T.previewBounds
		local fit = math.min((w - 12) / math.max(0.1, bounds[2] - bounds[1]), (h - 12) / math.max(0.1, bounds[4] - bounds[3]))
		local scale = fit * math.max(0.2, math.min(5, self.ZoomMultiplier))
		self._T.mapScale = scale
		self._T.fitScale = fit
		self._T.mapCx = self._T.mapCx or (bounds[1] + bounds[2]) / 2
		self._T.mapCy = self._T.mapCy or (bounds[3] + bounds[4]) / 2
		local player = _UserService.LocalPlayer
		if isvalid(player) then
			local pos = player.TransformComponent.WorldPosition
			self:FollowPosition(pos.x, pos.y)
		else
			self:PlacePreviewGeometry()
		end
	end

	@ExecSpace("ClientOnly")
	method void FollowPosition(number worldX, number worldY)
		-- 중앙 여유 구간 안에서는 지도를 고정한다. 구간을 벗어날 때만 목표점을 잡아 부드럽게 이동한다.
		local b = self._T.previewBounds
		local scale = self._T.mapScale
		if b == nil or scale == nil or scale <= 0 or self._T.collapsed then return end
		local halfX, halfY = self._T.halfW / scale, self._T.halfH / scale
		local first = not self._T.followInitialized
		local cx, cy = self._T.mapCx, self._T.mapCy
		local advance = function(value, center, lo, hi, half, deadRatio, target)
			if hi - lo <= half * 2 then return (lo + hi) / 2, nil end
			local desired = math.max(lo + half, math.min(hi - half, value))
			if first or math.abs(value - center) > half * 1.5 then return desired, nil end
			if target == nil and math.abs(value - center) > half * deadRatio then target = desired end
			if target ~= nil then
				center = center + (target - center) * 0.28
				if math.abs(target - center) < 0.01 then center, target = target, nil end
			end
			return math.max(lo + half, math.min(hi - half, center)), target
		end
		cx, self._T.followTargetX = advance(worldX, cx, b[1], b[2], halfX, 0.62, self._T.followTargetX)
		cy, self._T.followTargetY = advance(worldY, cy, b[3], b[4], halfY, 0.70, self._T.followTargetY)
		self._T.mapCx, self._T.mapCy = cx, cy
		self._T.followInitialized = true
		self:PlacePreviewGeometry()
	end

	@ExecSpace("ClientOnly")
	method void PlacePreviewGeometry()
		-- 캐시된 지형 이미지만 이동한다. 추적/확대 중에는 카메라 재캡처를 하지 않는다.
		local scale = self._T.mapScale
		if scale == nil then return end
		for i, rec in ipairs(self._T.previewRects or {}) do
			local e = self._T.captureTiles[i]
			if isvalid(e) then
				e.UITransformComponent.anchoredPosition = Vector2((rec.x - self._T.mapCx) * scale, (rec.y - self._T.mapCy) * scale)
				e.UITransformComponent.RectSize = Vector2(rec.w * scale, rec.h * scale)
			end
		end
		if #(self._T.previewRects or {}) > 0 then return end
		-- 캡처가 불가능한 맵도 확대/추적과 동일한 좌표로 발판을 그린다.
		for i, ent in ipairs(self._T.fhPool or {}) do
			local f = (self._T.footholds or {})[i]
			if isvalid(ent) then
				ent.Enable = false
				if f ~= nil then
					local sp, ep = f.StartPoint, f.EndPoint
					local line = self:ClipPreviewLine((sp.x-self._T.mapCx)*scale, (sp.y-self._T.mapCy)*scale, (ep.x-self._T.mapCx)*scale, (ep.y-self._T.mapCy)*scale)
					if line ~= nil then
						local dx, dy = line[3]-line[1], line[4]-line[2]
						local tf = ent.UITransformComponent
						tf.anchoredPosition = Vector2((line[1]+line[3])/2, (line[2]+line[4])/2 + self._T.contentOffsetY)
						tf.RectSize = Vector2(math.max(1, math.sqrt(dx*dx+dy*dy)), f.IsBlockVerticalLine and 3 or 4)
						tf.ZRotation = math.deg(math.atan(dy, dx))
						ent.Enable = true
					end
				end
			end
		end
	end

	@ExecSpace("ClientOnly")
	method table ClipPreviewLine(number x1, number y1, number x2, number y2)
		-- Liang–Barsky: 확대한 발판이 미니맵 프레임 밖으로 튀어나오지 않도록 선분을 자른다.
		local hw, hh = self._T.halfW - 2, self._T.halfH - 2
		local dx, dy = x2-x1, y2-y1
		local ps, qs = {-dx, dx, -dy, dy}, {x1+hw, hw-x1, y1+hh, hh-y1}
		local first, last = 0, 1
		for i = 1, 4 do
			local p, q = ps[i], qs[i]
			if math.abs(p) < 0.00001 then
				if q < 0 then return nil end
			elseif p < 0 then
				first = math.max(first, q/p)
			else
				last = math.min(last, q/p)
			end
			if first > last then return nil end
		end
		return {x1+first*dx, y1+first*dy, x1+last*dx, y1+last*dy}
	end

	@ExecSpace("ClientOnly")
	method void RestoreCapture(boolean keepCover)
		-- 성공/실패/종료 모두 같은 복구 경로를 거친다. 서버의 플레이 상태는 건드리지 않는다.
		local state = self._T.captureState
		if state ~= nil then
			if isvalid(state.camera) then
				-- ZoomRatio와 허용 여부는 순서가 중요하므로 일반 속성과 따로 복원한다.
				for key, value in pairs(state.cameraValues or {}) do
					if key ~= "ZoomRatio" and key ~= "IsAllowZoomInOut" then state.camera[key] = value end
				end
				if state.actualZoom ~= nil then
					state.camera.IsAllowZoomInOut = true
					state.camera.ZoomRatio = state.actualZoom
					if _CameraService:GetCurrentCameraComponent() == state.camera then
						_CameraService:ZoomTo(state.actualZoom, 0)
					end
					state.camera.IsAllowZoomInOut = state.cameraValues.IsAllowZoomInOut
				end
			end
			for _, rec in ipairs(state.hidden or {}) do
				local actor = rec.entity
				if isvalid(rec.nameTag) then rec.nameTag.Enable = rec.enabled end
				if isvalid(actor) then
					local monster = actor:GetComponent("script.Monster")
					local canRestore = not isvalid(monster) or not monster.IsDead
					if actor == _UserService.LocalPlayer and not _LoginFlow:IsInGame() then canRestore = false end
					if canRestore then actor:SetVisible(true, false, false) end
				end
			end
			self._T.pendingBackgrounds = state.backgrounds

			_CameraService.TransitionBlendTime = state.blend
		end
		self._T.captureState = nil
		if keepCover then return end
		self:RestoreBackgrounds()
		local cover = _EntityService:GetEntityByPath("/ui/MiniMapCaptureUI")
		if isvalid(cover) then
			cover.Enable = false
			local screen = cover:GetChildByName("Screen", false)
			if isvalid(screen) then screen.RawImageGUIRendererComponent:SetRawImage(nil) end
		end
	end


	@ExecSpace("ClientOnly")
	method void RestoreBackgrounds()
		-- 촬영 배율에서 배경 템플릿을 재생성하지 않는다. 필드 시야 정착 뒤 호출한다.
		local records = self._T.pendingBackgrounds or {}
		self._T.pendingBackgrounds = nil
		for _, rec in ipairs(records) do
			local bg = rec.component
			if isvalid(bg) and rec.changed then
				if rec.kind == BackgroundType.Template then bg:ChangeBackgroundByTemplateRUID(rec.template)
				elseif rec.kind == BackgroundType.SolidColor then bg:ChangeBackgroundBySolidColor(rec.solid) end
				if Environment:IsMakerPlay() then log("[VRF] MiniMap background rebuilt template=" .. tostring(rec.template) .. " zoom=" .. tostring(_CameraService.currentZoomRatio)) end
			end
		end
	end

	@ExecSpace("ClientOnly")
	method boolean IsReadyForReveal(Entity map)
		-- 접힌 미니맵은 촬영하지 않으며, 펼친 상태는 복원이 끝난 뒤에만 맵을 드러낸다.
		return not self._T.capturing and (self._T.collapsed or self._T.builtMap == map)
	end

	@ExecSpace("ClientOnly")
	method boolean WaitForTerrain(Entity map)
		-- Wait for static object sprites before capture. Imported tilesets are loaded by the map itself.
		local resources, seen = {}, {}
		for _, renderer in ipairs(map:GetChildComponentsByTypeName("MOD.Core.SpriteRendererComponent", true)) do
			local id = renderer.SpriteRUID
			if id ~= "" and not seen[id] and not isvalid(renderer.Entity:GetComponent("script.Monster")) then
				seen[id] = true table.insert(resources, id)
			end
		end
		local pending = #resources > 0 and 1 or 0
		local loaded = true
		if #resources > 0 then
			_ResourceService:PreloadAsync(resources, function(results)
				for _, result in ipairs(results) do if result ~= PreloadResultStatus.Success then loaded = false end end
				pending = pending - 1
			end)
		end
		for attempt = 1, 600 do
			if self._T.ending or not isvalid(map) or not isvalid(_UserService.LocalPlayer) or _UserService.LocalPlayer.CurrentMap ~= map then return false end
			if pending <= 0 then
				wait(0.1)
				if Environment:IsMakerPlay() then log("[VRF] MiniMap terrain ready map=" .. map.Name .. " sprites=" .. tostring(#resources) .. " loaded=" .. tostring(loaded)) end
				return loaded
			end
			wait(0.05)
		end
		log_warning("[MiniMap] terrain loading timed out: " .. map.Name)
		return false
	end

	@ExecSpace("ClientOnly")
	method void CapturePreview(Entity map)
		-- 30% 카메라 범위를 넘는 맵은 여러 장으로 나누어 실제 타일/오브젝트를 모두 담는다.
		local function stillHere()
			local player = _UserService.LocalPlayer
			return not self._T.ending and isvalid(map) and isvalid(map.MapComponent) and isvalid(player) and player.CurrentMap == map
		end
		if not stillHere() then return end
		self._T.capturing = true
		self._T.captureAttempts = (self._T.captureAttempts or 0) + 1
		local attempt = self._T.captureAttempts
		self:ClearPreview()
		local completed = false
		local success, reason = pcall(function()
			-- A first visit can still be downloading large Kritias object sprites.
			-- Never permanently cache a screenshot of partially loaded terrain.
			if not self:WaitForTerrain(map) or not stillHere() then return end
			local camera = _CameraService:GetCurrentCameraComponent()
			local cover = _EntityService:GetEntityByPath("/ui/MiniMapCaptureUI")
			if not isvalid(camera) or not isvalid(cover) then return end
			local code, frozen = _ScreenshotService:CaptureFullScreenAsPixelDataAndWait(true)
			if code ~= ScreenshotError.Success or not stillHere() or not isvalid(camera) then return end
			cover:GetChildByName("Screen", false).RawImageGUIRendererComponent:SetRawImage(frozen)
			cover.Enable = true
			local state = {camera = camera, map = map, blend = _CameraService.TransitionBlendTime, actualZoom = math.max(_FieldCameraBounds:GetBaseZoom(), camera.ZoomRatio), hidden = {}, backgrounds = {}, cameraValues = {}}
			for _, key in ipairs({"ConfineCameraArea", "UseCustomBound", "ScreenOffset", "CameraOffset", "Damping", "DeadZone", "SoftZone", "IsAllowZoomInOut", "ZoomRatio", "DutchAngle"}) do state.cameraValues[key] = camera[key] end
			self._T.captureState = state
			local backgrounds = map:GetChildComponentsByTypeName("MOD.Core.BackgroundComponent", true)
			if isvalid(map.BackgroundComponent) then table.insert(backgrounds, map.BackgroundComponent) end
			local seenBackgrounds = {}
			for _, bg in ipairs(backgrounds) do
				if seenBackgrounds[bg.Entity.Id] then continue end
				seenBackgrounds[bg.Entity.Id] = true
				local rec = {component = bg, kind = bg.Type, template = bg.TemplateRUID, solid = bg.SolidColor, changed = false}
				-- Enable 재활성화만으로 네이티브 배경 조각이 복원되지 않는 맵이 있다.
				if bg.Enable and (bg.Type == BackgroundType.Template or bg.Type == BackgroundType.SolidColor) then
					rec.changed = true
					bg:ChangeBackgroundBySolidColor(Color(0, 0, 0, 0))
				end
				table.insert(state.backgrounds, rec)
			end
			-- 렌더러 Enable을 끄면 진행 중인 모션/표정의 종료 이벤트를 놓칠 수 있다.
			-- 배우 루트의 클라이언트 표시만 숨기고 애니메이션과 서버 상태는 계속 갱신한다.
			local hiddenIds = {}
			for _, typeName in ipairs({"SpriteRendererComponent", "AvatarRendererComponent", "SkeletonRendererComponent", "TextRendererComponent", "NameTagComponent"}) do
				for _, renderer in ipairs(map:GetChildComponentsByTypeName("MOD.Core." .. typeName, true)) do
					local e = renderer.Entity
					local actor = e
					local dynamic = typeName == "NameTagComponent" or typeName == "AvatarRendererComponent"
					while isvalid(e) and e ~= map do
						if isvalid(e.PlayerComponent) or isvalid(e:GetComponent("script.Monster")) or isvalid(e.MovementComponent) then dynamic = true; actor = e; break end
						e = e.Parent
					end
					if dynamic and (isvalid(actor.PlayerComponent) or isvalid(actor.AvatarRendererComponent)) then
						if typeName == "NameTagComponent" then
							-- 이름표는 애니메이션과 무관하며 플레이어 루트를 숨기지 않고 별도로 제외한다.
							table.insert(state.hidden, {nameTag = renderer, enabled = renderer.Enable})
							renderer.Enable = false
							continue
						end
						-- 플레이어 루트 Visible은 맵 이동과 동기화되는 게임 상태다.
						-- 서버에 없는 로컬 아바타 루트만 가려 맵 전환 뒤에도 플레이어가 숨지 않게 한다.
						local avatar = actor.AvatarRendererComponent
						actor = isvalid(avatar) and avatar:GetAvatarRootEntity() or nil
					end
					if dynamic and isvalid(actor) and not hiddenIds[actor.Id] and actor.Visible then
						hiddenIds[actor.Id] = true
						table.insert(state.hidden, {entity = actor})
						actor:SetVisible(false, false, false)
					end
				end
			end
			---@type CameraComponent
			local previewCamera = camera
			previewCamera.ConfineCameraArea = false
			previewCamera.UseCustomBound = false
			previewCamera.ScreenOffset = Vector2(0.5, 0.5)
			previewCamera.Damping = Vector2.zero
			previewCamera.DeadZone = Vector2.zero
			previewCamera.SoftZone = Vector2.zero
			previewCamera.IsAllowZoomInOut = true
			previewCamera.ZoomRatio = 30
			previewCamera.DutchAngle = 0
			_CameraService.TransitionBlendTime = 0
			-- 속성 변경만으로는 실제 줌이 늦게 적용될 수 있어 네이티브 줌도 즉시 맞춘다.
			_CameraService:ZoomTo(30, 0)
			wait(0.25)
			if not stillHere() or not isvalid(previewCamera) then return end
			local lo, hi = map.MapComponent:GetBound()
			local minX, maxX, minY, maxY = lo.x, hi.x, lo.y, hi.y
			if self._T.previewBounds ~= nil then
				local b = self._T.previewBounds
				minX, maxX, minY, maxY = b[1], b[2], b[3], b[4]
			end
			local a = _UILogic:ScreenToWorldPosition(Vector2.zero)
			local z = _UILogic:ScreenToWorldPosition(Vector2(_UILogic.ScreenWidth, _UILogic.ScreenHeight))
			local tileW, tileH = math.abs(z.x-a.x), math.abs(z.y-a.y)
			if tileW < 1 or tileH < 1 then return end
			-- 지형뿐 아니라 현재 표시 영역 전체를 덮는다. 반투명 검정에 빈 사각형이 생기지 않는다.
			local previewSize = self._T.viewport.UITransformComponent.RectSize
			local previewScale = math.max(0.01, self._T.mapScale or 1)
			local spanW = math.max(maxX-minX, previewSize.x / previewScale)
			local spanH = math.max(maxY-minY, previewSize.y / previewScale)
			local cols = math.max(1, math.ceil(spanW/tileW))
			local rows = math.max(1, math.ceil(spanH/tileH))
			if cols * rows > 32 then log_warning("[MiniMap] 맵 캡처 범위 초과"); return end
			local cx, cy = (minX+maxX)/2, (minY+maxY)/2
			self._T.previewBounds = {minX,maxX,minY,maxY}
			for row = 1, rows do
				for col = 1, cols do
					if not stillHere() then return end
					local x = cx + (col-(cols+1)/2)*tileW
					local y = cy + (row-(rows+1)/2)*tileH
					-- 고정 대기 시간 대신 실제 화면 중심 도착을 확인해 이전 타일 중복 캡처를 막는다.
					local settled = false
					for attempt = 1, 40 do
						if not stillHere() or not isvalid(previewCamera) then return end
						local origin = previewCamera.Entity.TransformComponent.WorldPosition
						previewCamera.CameraOffset = Vector2(x-origin.x,y-origin.y)
						wait(0.025)
						if not stillHere() or not isvalid(previewCamera) then return end
						local center = _UILogic:ScreenToWorldPosition(Vector2(_UILogic.ScreenWidth/2, _UILogic.ScreenHeight/2))
						if math.abs(center.x-x) < 0.04 and math.abs(center.y-y) < 0.04 then settled = true; break end
					end
					if not settled then log_warning("[MiniMap] capture camera did not settle"); return end
					local captureLo = _UILogic:ScreenToWorldPosition(Vector2.zero)
					local captureHi = _UILogic:ScreenToWorldPosition(Vector2(_UILogic.ScreenWidth, _UILogic.ScreenHeight))
					local result, pixels = _ScreenshotService:CaptureFullScreenAsPixelDataAndWait(false)
					if result ~= ScreenshotError.Success or not stillHere() then return end
					local index = (row-1)*cols+col
					local tile = self._T.captureTiles[index]
					tile.RawImageGUIRendererComponent:SetRawImage(pixels)
					tile.Enable = true
					self._T.previewRects[index] = {x=(captureLo.x+captureHi.x)/2,y=(captureLo.y+captureHi.y)/2,w=math.abs(captureHi.x-captureLo.x),h=math.abs(captureHi.y-captureLo.y)}
				end
			end
			for _, e in ipairs(self._T.fhPool) do if isvalid(e) then e.Enable = false end end
			self:LayoutPreview()
			completed = true
			if Environment:IsMakerPlay() then log("[VRF] MiniMap actual terrain captured map=" .. map.Name .. " tiles=" .. tostring(cols*rows) .. " background=false actors=false") end
		end)
		local state = self._T.captureState
		self:RestoreCapture(true)
		-- 덮개 아래에서 필드 경계/기본 배율을 먼저 적용하고 배경을 복원한다.
		self._T.restoringCamera = true
		if state ~= nil and isvalid(state.camera) and not self._T.ending then
			state.camera.Damping = Vector2.zero
			state.camera.DeadZone = Vector2.zero
			state.camera.SoftZone = Vector2.zero
			for settle = 1, 80 do
				if not stillHere() then break end
				_FieldCameraBounds:OnUpdate(0.25)
				wait(0.05)
				if _FieldCameraBounds:IsReady(map) then break end
			end
		end
		self:RestoreBackgrounds()
		if state ~= nil and isvalid(state.camera) and not self._T.ending then
			wait(0.15)
			if isvalid(state.camera) then
				state.camera.Damping = state.cameraValues.Damping
				state.camera.DeadZone = state.cameraValues.DeadZone
				state.camera.SoftZone = state.cameraValues.SoftZone
			end
		end
		self._T.restoringCamera = nil
		self._T.capturing = false
		self:RestoreCapture(false)
		if stillHere() then if Environment:IsMakerPlay() then log("[VRF] MiniMap reveal map=" .. map.Name .. " cameraReady=" .. tostring(_FieldCameraBounds:IsReady(map)) .. " zoom=" .. tostring(_CameraService.currentZoomRatio)) end end
		if not stillHere() then completed = false end
		if not completed then
			self:ClearPreview()
			if stillHere() then
				self:RebuildFootholds(map)
				self:LayoutPreview()
				-- 리소스 오류 때 20Hz로 재촬영하면 필드 카메라가 계속 대기한다.
				-- 발판 미니맵을 유지하고 최대 3회만 간격을 두어 재시도한다.
				if attempt < 3 then
					self._T.captureRetryMap = map
					self._T.captureRetryDelay = 5 * attempt
				end
				if Environment:IsMakerPlay() then log("[VRF] MiniMap fallback map=" .. map.Name .. " attempt=" .. tostring(attempt) .. " cameraReleased=true") end
			else self._T.builtMap = nil end
		end
		self._T.capturing = false
		if Environment:IsMakerPlay() then log("[MiniMap] camera restored zoom=" .. tostring(_CameraService.currentZoomRatio)) end
		if not success then log_warning("[MiniMap] capture failed: " .. tostring(reason)) end
	end

	@ExecSpace("ClientOnly")
	method void UpdateMapIdentity(Entity map)
		local rawName = _ChannelManager:BaseName(map.Name or "Map")
		local displayName = rawName
		local region = "빅토리아 아일랜드"
		local page = _WorldMapManager:GetPageForMap(rawName)
		local regionNames = {victoria = "빅토리아 아일랜드", sleepywood = "슬리피우드", elnath = "엘나스 산맥", minar = "미나르숲", ludus = "루더스 호수", nautilus = "노틸러스", ellinel = "요정학원 엘리넬", goldbeach = "골드비치", mushroom = "버섯의 성", kerningtower = "커닝타워", ellodin = "비밀의숲 엘로딘", deadmine = "폐광"}
		for _, entry in ipairs(_RegionExpansionCatalog:Regions()) do regionNames[entry.key] = entry.title end
		if regionNames[page] ~= nil then
			region = regionNames[page]
			local regionalName = _WorldMapManager:GetMapDisplayName(rawName)
			if regionalName ~= "" then displayName = regionalName end
		end
		if string.match(rawName, "^0%d%d%d%d%d%d%d%d$") then region = "메이플 아일랜드" end
		if rawName == "001010000" then displayName = "모험가 수련장 입구" end
		if rawName == "map01" then displayName = "평온한 숲길" end
        if _BossStageManager:IsArena(rawName) then region="보스 스테이지" displayName=(({[1]="마노의 초원",[2]="스텀피의 돌풍 고원",[3]="킹 슬라임의 숲",[4]="커닝시티 도적단",[5]="해초의 탑 · 세르프"})[_BossStageManager._T.stage or 1] or (_RegionalBossCatalog:Stage(_BossStageManager._T.stage or 1) or {}).mapTitle or "보스 전장") end
		if isvalid(self._T.mapName) then
			if isvalid(self._T.mapName.TextComponent) then self._T.mapName.TextComponent.Text = displayName
			elseif isvalid(self._T.mapName.TextGUIRendererComponent) then self._T.mapName.TextGUIRendererComponent.Text = displayName end
		end
		if isvalid(self._T.regionName) then
			if isvalid(self._T.regionName.TextComponent) then self._T.regionName.TextComponent.Text = region
			elseif isvalid(self._T.regionName.TextGUIRendererComponent) then self._T.regionName.TextGUIRendererComponent.Text = region end
		end
	end

	@ExecSpace("ClientOnly")
	method void RebuildFootholds(Entity map)
		-- 발판 전체(GetFootholdAll)의 경계를 재서 보드 안에 비율 유지로 축소해 그린다.
		self._T.previewBounds = nil
		self._T.markerMap = nil
		self._T.footholds = {}
		local fhComp = map.FootholdComponent
		local all = isvalid(fhComp) and fhComp:GetFootholdAll() or nil
		local list = {}
		local minX, maxX, minY, maxY = math.huge, -math.huge, math.huge, -math.huge
		for _, f in ipairs(all or {}) do
			local sp = f.StartPoint
			local ep = f.EndPoint
			minX = math.min(minX, sp.x, ep.x)
			maxX = math.max(maxX, sp.x, ep.x)
			minY = math.min(minY, sp.y, ep.y)
			maxY = math.max(maxY, sp.y, ep.y)
			table.insert(list, f)
		end
		if #list == 0 then
			-- 발판 없는 맵: 전부 숨긴다.
			for i = 1, self.FhPool do
				local e = self._T.fhPool[i]
				if isvalid(e) then e.Enable = false end
			end
			self._T.builtMap = map
			self._T.mapScale = nil
			return
		end
		-- 풀보다 발판이 많으면 긴 것부터 그린다(짧은 조각 생략이 지형 윤곽 훼손이 가장 적다).
		table.sort(list, function(a, b) return a.Length > b.Length end)
		self._T.footholds = list
		local bs = self._T.board.UITransformComponent.RectSize
		local w = bs.x - 48
		local h = bs.y - 144
        -- Boss arenas frame the combat area above the foothold, not the underground tiles.
        local bossArena=_BossStageManager:IsArena(map.Name)
        if bossArena then
            minY=-0.15
            if (_BossStageManager._T.stage or 1)==5 then maxY=5.46 else maxY=math.max(0,maxY) end
        end
        minX, maxX, minY, maxY = minX - 0.5, maxX + 0.5, minY - (bossArena and 0.35 or 1.2), maxY + (bossArena and ((_BossStageManager._T.stage or 1)==5 and 0.35 or 2.1) or 0.7)
        if bossArena then if Environment:IsMakerPlay() then log("[BossStage] minimap bounds bottom="..tostring(minY).." top="..tostring(maxY)) end end
		local view = _FieldCameraBounds:MapView(map.Name)
		if view ~= nil and not bossArena then
			local b = view.mini
			minX, maxX, minY, maxY = b[1], b[2], b[3], b[4]
		end
		self._T.previewBounds = {minX, maxX, minY, maxY}
		local spanX = math.max(0.1, maxX - minX)
		local spanY = math.max(0.1, maxY - minY)
		local scale = math.min(w / spanX, h / spanY)
		local cx = (minX + maxX) * 0.5
		local cy = (minY + maxY) * 0.5
		self._T.mapScale = scale
		self._T.mapCx = cx
		self._T.mapCy = cy
		self._T.halfW = w * 0.5
		self._T.halfH = h * 0.5
		self._T.contentOffsetY = -49
		for i = 1, self.FhPool do
			local ent = self._T.fhPool[i]
			if isvalid(ent) then
				local f = list[i]
				if f ~= nil then
					local sp = f.StartPoint
					local ep = f.EndPoint
					local dx = ep.x - sp.x
					local dy = ep.y - sp.y
					local ut = ent.UITransformComponent
					ut.anchoredPosition = Vector2(((sp.x + ep.x) * 0.5 - cx) * scale, ((sp.y + ep.y) * 0.5 - cy) * scale + self._T.contentOffsetY)
					local terrainThickness = 4
					if f.IsBlockVerticalLine then terrainThickness = 3 end
					ut.RectSize = Vector2(math.max(3, math.sqrt(dx * dx + dy * dy) * scale), terrainThickness)
					ut.ZRotation = math.deg(math.atan(dy, dx))
					local spr = ent.SpriteGUIRendererComponent
					if isvalid(spr) then
						spr.Type = ImageType.Simple
						if f.IsBlockVerticalLine then
							spr.Color = Color(0.66, 0.74, 0.78, 0.72)
						else
							spr.Color = Color(0.86, 0.94, 0.78, 0.96)
						end
					end
					ent.Enable = true
				else
					ent.Enable = false
				end
			end
		end
		self._T.builtMap = map
		self:LayoutPreview()
		if Environment:IsMakerPlay() then log("[MiniMap] 발판 레이아웃 갱신 - " .. tostring(#list) .. "개") end
	end

	@ExecSpace("ClientOnly")
	method boolean RebuildMapLayer(Entity map)
		local renderers = map:GetChildComponentsByTypeName("MOD.Core.SpriteRendererComponent", true)
		local list = {}
		local minX = math.huge
		local maxX = -math.huge
		local minY = math.huge
		local maxY = -math.huge
		for _, renderer in ipairs(renderers) do
			if renderer.SpriteRUID ~= "" and string.find(tostring(renderer.SortingLayer), "MapLayer", 1, true) ~= nil then
				local pos = renderer.Entity.TransformComponent.WorldPosition
				table.insert(list, { renderer = renderer, pos = pos })
				minX = math.min(minX, pos.x)
				maxX = math.max(maxX, pos.x)
				minY = math.min(minY, pos.y)
				maxY = math.max(maxY, pos.y)
			end
		end
		if #list == 0 then return false end
		table.sort(list, function(a, b) return a.renderer.OrderInLayer < b.renderer.OrderInLayer end)

		local bs = self._T.board.UITransformComponent.RectSize
		local w = bs.x - 28
		local h = bs.y - 82
		local scale = math.min(w / math.max(0.1, maxX - minX), h / math.max(0.1, maxY - minY))
		local cx = (minX + maxX) * 0.5
		local cy = (minY + maxY) * 0.5
		self._T.mapScale = scale
		self._T.mapCx = cx
		self._T.mapCy = cy
		self._T.halfW = w * 0.5
		self._T.halfH = h * 0.5
		self._T.contentOffsetY = -22

		for i = 1, self.FhPool do
			local ent = self._T.fhPool[i]
			if isvalid(ent) then
				if i <= #list then
					local rec = list[i]
					local ui = ent.UITransformComponent
					local spr = ent.SpriteGUIRendererComponent
					spr.ImageRUID = rec.renderer.SpriteRUID
					spr.Type = ImageType.Simple
					spr.Color = Color(1, 1, 1, 0.96)
					spr:SetNativeSize()
					local native = ui.RectSize
					local worldScale = rec.renderer.Entity.TransformComponent.Scale
					local factor = scale / 100
					ui.RectSize = Vector2(math.max(2, native.x * math.abs(worldScale.x) * factor), math.max(2, native.y * math.abs(worldScale.y) * factor))
					ui.anchoredPosition = Vector2((rec.pos.x - cx) * scale, (rec.pos.y - cy) * scale + self._T.contentOffsetY)
					ui.ZRotation = rec.renderer.Entity.TransformComponent.ZRotation
					ent.Enable = true
				else
					ent.Enable = false
				end
			end
		end
		self._T.builtMap = map
		if Environment:IsMakerPlay() then log("[MiniMap] Map Layer 스프라이트 갱신 - " .. tostring(math.min(#list, self.FhPool)) .. "개") end
		return true
	end

	@ExecSpace("ClientOnly")
	method void UpdateMarkers(Entity map, Entity player)
		-- 보이는 범위의 대상만 풀에 할당한다. 화면 밖 대상을 가장자리에 몰아넣지 않는다.
		local scale = self._T.mapScale
		if scale == nil then return end
		local cx = self._T.mapCx
		local cy = self._T.mapCy
		local hw = self._T.halfW
		local hh = self._T.halfH
		local oy = self._T.contentOffsetY or 0
		-- 몬스터(빨강): 살아있는 것만.
		if self._T.markerMap ~= map or (self._T.scanAcc or 0) >= 0.2 then
            self._T.markerMobs = map:GetChildComponentsByTypeName("script.Monster", true)
            -- Reserve a marker for the boss even when summoned monsters fill the pool.
            table.sort(self._T.markerMobs,function(a,b)
                return isvalid(a) and a.IsStageBoss and (not isvalid(b) or not b.IsStageBoss)
            end)
			self._T.markerPlayers = map:GetChildComponentsByTypeName("MOD.Core.PlayerComponent", true)
			self._T.markerMap = map
			self._T.scanAcc = 0
		end
		local mobs = self._T.markerMobs
		local mi = 0
		for _, comp in ipairs(mobs or {}) do
			---@type Monster
			local mc = comp
			if isvalid(mc) and isvalid(mc.Entity) and mc.Entity.Enable and not mc.IsDead and not isvalid(mc.Entity:GetComponent("script.ThiefEncounter")) then
				local wp = mc.Entity.TransformComponent.WorldPosition
				local x, y = (wp.x - cx) * scale, (wp.y - cy) * scale
				if math.abs(x) > hw or math.abs(y) > hh then continue end
				mi = mi + 1
				if mi > self.MobPool then break end
				local e = self._T.mobPool[mi]
				if isvalid(e) then
                    local size=self._T.mobSizes[mi]
                    local factor=mc.IsStageBoss and 1.5 or 1
                    e.UITransformComponent.RectSize=Vector2(size.x*factor,size.y*factor)
                    e.UITransformComponent.anchoredPosition = Vector2(x, y + oy)
					e.Enable = true
				end
			end
		end
		for i = math.min(mi, self.MobPool) + 1, self.MobPool do
			local e = self._T.mobPool[i]
			if isvalid(e) then e.Enable = false end
		end
		-- 다른 플레이어(빨강). 소환수나 장식 이미지는 미니맵에 표시하지 않는다.
		local sums = self._T.markerPlayers
		local si = 0
		for _, comp in ipairs(sums or {}) do
			local sc = comp
			if isvalid(sc) and isvalid(sc.Entity) and sc.Entity ~= player then
				local wp = sc.Entity.TransformComponent.WorldPosition
				local x, y = (wp.x - cx) * scale, (wp.y - cy) * scale
				if math.abs(x) > hw or math.abs(y) > hh then continue end
				si = si + 1
				if si > self.SumPool then break end
				local e = self._T.sumPool[si]
				if isvalid(e) then
					e.UITransformComponent.anchoredPosition = Vector2(x, y + oy)
					e.Enable = true
				end
			end
		end
		for i = math.min(si, self.SumPool) + 1, self.SumPool do
			local e = self._T.sumPool[i]
			if isvalid(e) then e.Enable = false end
		end
		-- 플레이어(노랑).
		local ply = self._T.ply
		if isvalid(ply) then
			local wp = player.TransformComponent.WorldPosition
			ply.UITransformComponent.anchoredPosition = Vector2(
				math.max(-hw, math.min(hw, (wp.x - cx) * scale)),
				math.max(-hh, math.min(hh, (wp.y - cy) * scale)) + oy)
			ply.Enable = true
		end
	end

end
